<title>OMAN: Oman United Insurance 1996 profits up.</title>
<headline>Oman United Insurance 1996 profits up.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(Million Omani rials unless stated, rounded)</p>
<p>    Net profit after taxation	   1.02   vs   0.87</p>
<p>    Investment income		     1.03   vs   0.60</p>
<p>    Other income			    0.23   vs   0.97</p>
<p>    Proposed dividend		     0.90   vs   0.72</p>
<p>Full name: Oman United Insurance Company.</p>
<p>$1=0.377 rials</p>
</text>
